Vendored files (verbatim or 1:1 extracted constants):
- src/lib/godmode-prompt.ts
- src/lib/libertas.ts
- godmode-pipeline.ts — DEPTH_DIRECTIVE + applyGodmodeBoost extracted from
  api/lib/ultraplinian.ts and re-exporting the modules above
- godmode_bundle.json — machine-readable dump of the same constants for the
  skill runners (not a reimplementation of novel prompt logic)

Rebuild / drift-check the JSON from the TypeScript sources (repo root):

  python3 scripts/export_bundle.py           # rewrite godmode_bundle.json
  python3 scripts/export_bundle.py --check   # exit 0 if JSON matches TS

This skill does not invent a parallel GODMODE pipeline. It runs the upstream
GODMODE constants and wiring described in G0DM0D3's api/routes/chat.ts
(runPipeline): system prompt + DEPTH_DIRECTIVE, optional Hall of Fame combo
from libertas.ts, and applyGodmodeBoost on sampling params.

